  "body": "3 Bedrooms | 2 Bathrooms | Study Nook + Garage | Only 2 Left\r\n\r\n50% already sold! With titles now issued, you can secure your new home and move in before Christmas.\r\nA rare opportunity to secure a meticulously crafted sanctuary that completely redefines new construction. Designed in collaboration by artists and architects, this home proves that true quality cannot be rushed.\r\n\r\nKey Features & Highlights:\r\n\r\n* Not all new builds are created equal. Experience the standard you deserve.\r\n* Uncompromised Craftsmanship: Step inside and feel the difference. From lush, designer landscaping to hand-selected fixtures and premium finishes, every detail is elevated.\r\n* More of Everything: Designed for the discerning buyer offering superior light, generous proportions, intelligent storage, and a layout that truly feels like home.\r\n\r\nContact Richard today to schedule your private inspection.",
